hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"18237","Waki and Abd al-Rahman narrated to us from Said ibn Abd al-Aziz from Sulayman ibn Musa from Abu Sayyarah, Abd al-Rahman said al-Mutii, he said: I said: O Messenger of Allah, I have palm trees. He said: Pay the tenth. He said: I said: O Messenger of Allah, protect them for me. He said: So he protected them for me. Abd al-Rahman said: Protect its mountain for me. He said: So he protected its mountain for me."
